{"unit_id":"yuloop__dsh-web-split#card-zh","repo":"yuloop/dsh-web-split","commit":"37320d1ee323a56c5e4cf8b5af7ba68fb5ebe534","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-split 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的自由分屏插件，在侧栏注册「分屏」入口并打开主面板，通过官方会话槽位在多个窗格中显示独立对话。用户可以拖入侧栏会话、左右或上下拆分窗格、拖动分隔线调整比例、交换会话，并导入正在运行的会话；布局会保存在浏览器本地，界面提供中英文。适合需要同时查看和操作多个 DSH 会话的 Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 及插件声明的官方 UI 包。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:5-19","client.js:2287-2324"]}
{"unit_id":"yuloop__dsh-web-split#card-en","repo":"yuloop/dsh-web-split","commit":"37320d1ee323a56c5e4cf8b5af7ba68fb5ebe534","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-split adds a Web split-screen panel for DSH. Open sessions from the sidebar, split and resize panes, swap conversations, or import running sessions. Layouts persist in browser localStorage. Requires DSH Web and its declared UI packages.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:5-19","client.js:2287-2324"]}
